WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.100
Foundations, episode two. The brand.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.480
A 32 × 32 grid. 992 holes.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:13.160
Every unit, the same chevron. The unit number seeds the field, so the same number always makes the same mark.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.250
Wear it where it works. On the chest display, and the base-plate decal.

5
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.800
Find your way. Keep your distance. Six signs, one system.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.950
One tokens file. And every colour pair, checked for contrast.

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.630
Five status lights, each with its own motion, readable from across the floor.

8
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.860
A brand is a system other people can use.

